      "writtenOn": "2026-05-02T22:21:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we merge [1], this new instance can be avoided with consequent relief in terms of JVM heap pressure.\n\n[1] https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/modules/events-broker/+/578961\n\n\n\n```suggestion\n                          : () -\u003e {\n                            TopicPartition tp \u003d\n                                new TopicPartition(\n                                    consumerRecord.topic(), consumerRecord.partition());\n                            long offset \u003d consumerRecord.offset() + 1;\n                            try {\n                              consumer.commitSync(Map.of(tp, new OffsetAndMetadata(offset)));\n                            } catch (KafkaException e) {\n                              throw new MessageAcknowledgementException(\n                                  String.format(\n                                      \"Failed to acknowledge offset %d on %s\", offset, tp),\n                                  e);\n                            }\n                       });```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 185,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 185,
        "endChar": 84
      },
      "revId": "57ab43d5ce7b521221ddfd0223c24fdcf2eba5aa",
