      "writtenOn": "2026-05-04T15:30:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done, however, I am not sure this is actually a relief in terms of JVM heap pressure, since Java still needs to allocate an anonymous class for this lambda.\n\nI\u0027d only prefer the named class for readability and testability, unless there is some other benefit I am not thinking of in having this anonymous class being instantiated?",
